<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16479" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀστένακτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>without sigh</i> or
				<i>groan,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. κἀδάκρυτος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					1200
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				1074
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄκλαυτος ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Alc.</u>
					173
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἡμέρα</span> a day <i>free
				from groans,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Hec.</u>
				691
			</span></i> (lyr.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ax.</u>
				370d
			</span></i>, <i>Mél.Nicole</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				308
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Panticapaeum</span>). Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.107a
				</span></i>
			:—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀστενακτί</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				307
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ec.</u>
				464
			</span></i>.</div>
